        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Rock and Stone</strong>, you are a dwarf on a mission to get rich! While you'll be mining rocks and collecting valuable loot, your true fortune is made in the <strong>player-driven market</strong>. You'll need to decide whether to sell the items you find to other players or use them to speed up your own mining. With <strong>no pay-to-win </strong>in-game purchases, your success depends entirely on your gear, luck, and determination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock and Stone</strong> is a game that works for you, even when you're not playing. You will <strong>mine rocks in the background</strong>, automatically gathering <strong>Steam items</strong>. You can either sell these items on the market for a profit or open them for new gear and gold. You can occasionally click to use a limited <strong>stamina reserve</strong> to speed up mining manually. You can also purchase in-game buffs with gold you find, giving you temporary boosts. The stronger your gear, the faster you can mine and the better your chances of finding rare treasures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Looting &amp; Gear</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items come in five rarities: <strong>Common</strong>, <strong>Uncommon</strong>, <strong>Rare</strong>, <strong>Epic</strong>, and <strong>Legendary</strong>. Each rarity provides stronger stats and bigger bonuses. There are 11 stats that affect your mining, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage, crit chance and crit damage multiplier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff and gold chance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff duration and gold amount</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamina regeneration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-mining speed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can equip various types of gear, such as <strong>rocks</strong>, <strong>pickaxes</strong>, and <strong>pickaxe mods</strong>, to improve these stats and become an even more effective miner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buffs &amp; Gold</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While mining, you have a chance to find <strong>gold and </strong>temporary <strong>buffs</strong>. You can also buy longer-lasting buffs with gold at any time. There are four types of buffs that can give you a boost, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster auto-mining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster stamina regeneration</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reforge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reforge</strong> functionality allows you to combine <strong>12 items of the same rarity</strong> into <strong>one new item of the next higher rarity</strong> Look out for <strong>secret recipes</strong> that don't require all 12 items! A <strong>gold cost</strong>, which varies based on the item rarity, is associated with each reforge. You can enable Reforge mode <strong>using the button in your in-game inventory. </strong>Type of the output item is affected by the distribution of the input items types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933360/extras/15a7d08fa472eb29730e53c888a93bbb.avif?t=1771765536\" width=328 height=482 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Artifacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifacts are collectible items that grant <strong>stat bonuses</strong> to your character <strong>as long as they remain in your Steam inventory</strong>. They’re passive, and persistent. Each artifact provides fixed bonuses. Bonuses are <strong>automatically applied</strong> when the artifact is in your Steam inventory—no need to convert them to game items, equip or activate. Artifacts come in <strong>multiple rarities</strong>, just like other in-game items. The <strong>higher the rarity, the stronger and more numerous the bonuses</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933360/extras/153ce128a8fa8e248af39e644f4e8d01.avif?t=1771765536\" width=426 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the community! Connect with other miners, influence upcoming content and features, and be the first to know about <strong>events</strong> and <strong>promo codes</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Rock and Stone</strong>, you are a dwarf on a mission to get rich! While you'll be mining rocks and collecting valuable loot, your true fortune is made in the <strong>player-driven market</strong>. You'll need to decide whether to sell the items you find to other players or use them to speed up your own mining. With <strong>no pay-to-win </strong>in-game purchases, your success depends entirely on your gear, luck, and determination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rock and Stone</strong> is a game that works for you, even when you're not playing. You will <strong>mine rocks in the background</strong>, automatically gathering <strong>Steam items</strong>. You can either sell these items on the market for a profit or open them for new gear and gold. You can occasionally click to use a limited <strong>stamina reserve</strong> to speed up mining manually. You can also purchase in-game buffs with gold you find, giving you temporary boosts. The stronger your gear, the faster you can mine and the better your chances of finding rare treasures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Looting &amp; Gear</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items come in five rarities: <strong>Common</strong>, <strong>Uncommon</strong>, <strong>Rare</strong>, <strong>Epic</strong>, and <strong>Legendary</strong>. Each rarity provides stronger stats and bigger bonuses. There are 11 stats that affect your mining, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage, crit chance and crit damage multiplier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff and gold chance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff duration and gold amount</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamina regeneration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-mining speed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can equip various types of gear, such as <strong>rocks</strong>, <strong>pickaxes</strong>, and <strong>pickaxe mods</strong>, to improve these stats and become an even more effective miner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buffs &amp; Gold</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While mining, you have a chance to find <strong>gold and </strong>temporary <strong>buffs</strong>. You can also buy longer-lasting buffs with gold at any time. There are four types of buffs that can give you a boost, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster auto-mining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster stamina regeneration</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reforge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reforge</strong> functionality allows you to combine <strong>12 items of the same rarity</strong> into <strong>one new item of the next higher rarity</strong> Look out for <strong>secret recipes</strong> that don't require all 12 items! A <strong>gold cost</strong>, which varies based on the item rarity, is associated with each reforge. You can enable Reforge mode <strong>using the button in your in-game inventory. </strong>Type of the output item is affected by the distribution of the input items types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933360/extras/15a7d08fa472eb29730e53c888a93bbb.avif?t=1771765536\" width=328 height=482 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Artifacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifacts are collectible items that grant <strong>stat bonuses</strong> to your character <strong>as long as they remain in your Steam inventory</strong>. They’re passive, and persistent. Each artifact provides fixed bonuses. Bonuses are <strong>automatically applied</strong> when the artifact is in your Steam inventory—no need to convert them to game items, equip or activate. Artifacts come in <strong>multiple rarities</strong>, just like other in-game items. The <strong>higher the rarity, the stronger and more numerous the bonuses</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933360/extras/153ce128a8fa8e248af39e644f4e8d01.avif?t=1771765536\" width=426 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the community! Connect with other miners, influence upcoming content and features, and be the first to know about <strong>events</strong> and <strong>promo codes</strong>.</p>",
        "short_description": "Rock and Stone is an idle background mining game where you play as a dwarf, mining rocks for valuable loot. You can sell your loot on the community market for profit or use it to get new gear and gold. Equip different gear—from common to legendary—to boost your stats and mine even more effectively.",
